id: SEC-017
title: Broken Object Level Authorization (OWASP API1:2023)
category: security
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .js .ts .jsx .tsx
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: findById\(req\.params\.id\)
    message: Direct database lookup by user-supplied ID without ownership check — BOLA/IDOR vulnerability
  - regex: findOne\(\{\s*_id:\s*req\.
    message: MongoDB findOne by request param without user ownership filter — IDOR risk
fix: Always verify the requesting user owns the resource. Add .where({userId: req.user.id}) or equivalent.
